{"id":4381,"title":{"romaji":"Seishun Buta Yarou wa Randoseru Girl no Yume wo Minai","english":"Rascal Does Not Dream of a Knapsack Kid","native":"青春ブタ野郎はランドセルガールの夢を見ない"},"slug":"seishun_buta_yarou_wa_randoseru_girl_no_yume_wo_minai","synopsis":"March begins, and there is only one month left in the third term. Sakuta Azusagawa is about to celebrate the graduation of his girlfriend Mai Sakurajima. As he waits for Mai at Shichirigahama beach, an elementary school-aged girl who looks like Mai did when she was a child actress appears in front of him. While reflecting on this mysterious encounter, he receives a phone call from his father. Kaede’s mother never came to terms with what happened to Kaede. Having been hospitalized for so long, their mother finally wants to see her daughter. To fulfill their mother’s wish, Sakuta makes the decision to meet face-to-face–something they haven’t done in a long time. He’s unable to hide his nervousness about all this. Never-before-seen scars begin to appear on Sakuta’s body. Could these be warning signs of a new type of puberty syndrome?\n\n(Source: Fathom Events)","format":"MOVIE","season":"FALL","year":2023,"createdAt":"2024-08-02 02:20:17","updatedAt":"2024-08-02 02:20:17","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":11695},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17862},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":161474},{"site":"ANN","externalId":27636},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":47742},{"site":"MAL","externalId":54870},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":23244}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12008,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/a4vCzHlW6aycxHUgTDVmbqd1ugCfhNk1TYjzivSr.avif"},{"id":12009,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/JEuBwZiZBAiIsvY3h8W4rtd71Zx3VlZttWpsdh4J.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":151,"name":"CloverWorks","slug":"cloverworks"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":308,"name":"Seishun Buta Yarou","slug":"seishun_buta_yarou"}]},"animetheme